WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.197
Use the sliders to see how temperature and top P affect the same set of candidate tokens.

00:00:06.197 --> 00:00:13.177
Watch the probability bars rather than thinking only in terms of labels like creative or deterministic.

00:00:13.177 --> 00:00:18.317
The goal is to see exactly which candidates become more or less likely.

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:21.137
Move only one control at a time.

00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:27.166
If you change both sliders together, it becomes harder to tell which setting caused the new behavior.
